# Logs Fundamentals

## Introduction to Logs

Logs are records of system and user activity.

SOC analysts use logs to detect suspicious behavior and investigate incidents.

## Types of Logs

- Authentication Logs
- System Logs
- Web Logs

## Windows Event Logs

Event ID 4625 represents failed login attempts.

Repeated failed logins may indicate brute-force attacks.

## Conclusion

Logs are essential for monitoring and incident response.